msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr ""
"Redigera menystrukturen som JSON. Varje objekt kan ha: name, icon, command "
"(körs via skalet) eller action (en sessionsåtgärd: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (fält av objekt) "
"eller separator (true)."

